      "date": "2026-01-31T20:31:13.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.83 (vs ₹0.69 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.83 (up from ₹0.69 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹4.16b (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹102.4m (up 20% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.5% (up from 2.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 18% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 9.3% growth forecast for the Forestry industry in Asia. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 67 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
